        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "5. Any employee displaced from his or her job title shall be permitted to exercise seniority (computed on a University-wide basis) by bumping a less senior employee in a lower rated job title within the same School or administrative unit as defined above, provided he/she has the ability to immediately perform the available work. If an opening occurs in the grade and job title held at the time of layoff, the employee may be assigned to it at his/her former rate of pay plus any across-the-board",
